# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# JA_TRANSLATIONS — Japanese (日本語) support, for the Japan market (the
# single largest K-pop album-sales market — see 2026-07-30 chat context).
#
# Unlike ZH_CN (which was machine-converted from ZH_TW via OpenCC), Japan
# already has its OWN established idol-fandom vocabulary — some Korean
# fandom terms get borrowed as loanwords, but many have distinct native
# Japanese equivalents (e.g. 최애→推し, not a literal translation). So this
# dict is genuinely hand-written per word, category by category, same as
# ZH_TW originally was — no shortcut conversion available here.
#
# Same fallback rule as ZH_TW/ZH_CN: any word missing from this dict just
# shows English under the 日 toggle — never broken, just incomplete.
#
# Format: "한글 단어" : ("일본어 뜻풀이", "일본어 예문")
